146
10:48.600 --> 10:49.390
People say her mother

147
10:49.390 --> 10:51.050
was bitten to death by wolves.

148
10:51.500 --> 10:52.770
But I don't think so.

149
10:52.860 --> 10:54.070
Jiuying told me

150
10:54.270 --> 10:56.080
when she went into the mountains to look for her mother,

151
10:56.080 --> 10:57.140
