152
10:57.230 --> 10:58.760
It was a wolf that saved her.

153
10:58.990 --> 11:00.030
From then on,

154
11:00.070 --> 11:01.480
she ate and lived

155
11:01.480 --> 11:02.550
with the wolves.

156
11:02.870 --> 11:03.630
She also said

157
11:04.270 --> 11:06.600
the wolves helped her look for her mother.

158
11:07.630 --> 11:10.230
It's just that this search lasted for 12 years.

159
11:10.390 --> 11:12.380
No wonder Xia Jiuying's habits

160
11:12.480 --> 11:14.150
