300
16:17.860 --> 16:18.240
[Prosperous and Flourishing]

301
16:18.240 --> 16:19.030
Boss Ji.

302
16:19.840 --> 16:20.600
Today at the Hound Pit,

303
16:20.600 --> 16:21.840
