316
16:40.390 --> 16:42.740
She was even rewarded with a gold pendant afterwards.

317
16:42.740 --> 16:42.840
[Prosperous and Flourishing]

318
16:42.840 --> 16:43.840
Moreover,

319
16:43.840 --> 16:46.550
