338
17:20.960 --> 17:23.420
You collected Xia Jiuying's mother's body?

339
17:23.550 --> 17:25.030
She is still looking for her mother's remains.

340
17:25.030 --> 17:25.960
Why didn't you tell her

341
17:25.960 --> 17:26.829
