342
17:26.829 --> 17:28.240
She is just a fool!

343
17:28.310 --> 17:29.070
She's already dead.

344
17:29.070 --> 17:30.870
What's the use of a pile of bones?

345
17:31.160 --> 17:32.640
Mount Fuyao is so big,

346
17:33.070 --> 17:34.110
who remembers

347
17:34.350 --> 17:35.920
where she is buried?

348
17:51.400 --> 17:52.370
Boss Ji, what you said

349
17:52.370 --> 17:53.740
makes so much sense.

350
17:54.960 --> 17:55.930
So,

351
17:56.440 --> 17:57.640
if one day

352
17:57.860 --> 17:59.570
you die an unnatural death,

353
18:00.000 --> 18:01.960
and someone digs up your grave

354
18:01.980 --> 18:03.380
to scatter your remains,

355
18:04.240 --> 18:05.830
it wouldn't matter either.

356
18:06.480 --> 18:07.270
Right?

357
18:10.480 --> 18:12.080
Divine Constable Qingyang.

358
18:12.440 --> 18:15.170
Even if you are from the Divine Constable Bureau,

359
18:16.960 --> 18:20.750
how can you curse me like that?

360
18:30.240 --> 18:31.200
Isn't this what Boss Ji

361
18:31.200 --> 18:33.270
just said yourself?

362
18:34.030 --> 18:35.330
Since she's dead,

363
18:36.200 --> 18:37.830
what's the use of her bones?

364
18:45.240 --> 18:46.770
Didn't he say that himself?

365
18:48.730 --> 18:50.110
-Second Master. -Get out of the way!

366
18:50.110 --> 18:50.680
Second Master.

367
18:50.680 --> 18:51.640
This is my home.

368
18:51.640 --> 18:52.720
Why can't I walk around?

369
18:52.720 --> 18:54.710
-Master doesn’t allow you to walk around. -I want to see the Divine Constable.

370
18:54.710 --> 18:55.720
Second Master!

371
18:55.960 --> 18:57.260
-Let's go back. -Divine Constable!

372
18:57.260 --> 19:00.120
-Let's go back, Second Master. -Divine Constable!

373
19:05.580 --> 19:06.580
My Lords.

374
19:07.010 --> 19:08.540
That is my younger brother.

375
19:08.640 --> 19:09.790
He has a chronic illness.

376
19:09.790 --> 19:12.270
Normally, he's not allowed to interfere

377
19:12.270 --> 19:13.930
in any affairs in the mansion.

378
19:14.000 --> 19:15.790
I don't know what's wrong with him today.

379
19:15.790 --> 19:18.640
I'm afraid he might offend you, My Lords.

380
19:18.960 --> 19:20.490
I must go check on him first.

381
19:20.750 --> 19:22.000
Since Boss Ji has family matters

382
19:22.000 --> 19:22.830
to deal with,

383
19:22.830 --> 19:23.640
we won't

384
19:24.550 --> 19:25.880
bother you anymore.

385
19:26.070 --> 19:27.830
Boss Ji, after you settle your brother,

386
19:27.830 --> 19:29.030
come to the county office.

387
19:29.030 --> 19:31.160
There is something we need to confirm.

388
19:31.240 --> 19:32.000
Okay.

389
19:42.240 --> 19:43.240
Well, Qingyang,

390
19:43.550 --> 19:45.010
you were really not polite

391
19:45.240 --> 19:46.830
to Boss Ji.

392
19:47.210 --> 19:48.610
This man is greedy

393
19:48.640 --> 19:49.720
and shameless.

394
19:50.240 --> 19:51.770
I was actually being polite

395
19:52.000 --> 19:53.240
to him just now.

396
19:53.480 --> 19:54.270
Let's go.

397
19:55.830 --> 19:58.460
[Remain At Ease]

398
19:59.160 --> 20:00.090
There's no need!

399
20:00.270 --> 20:01.790
How many times have I told you?

400
20:01.790 --> 20:03.920
You are not allowed to meddle in the mansion's affairs.

401
20:03.920 --> 20:04.720
Brother.

402
20:04.830 --> 20:06.640
Is it true that you secretly opened a gambling den?

403
20:06.640 --> 20:07.440
Close it.

404
20:07.440 --> 20:08.880
I will go plead with the Divine Constable Bureau.

405
20:08.880 --> 20:12.000
-Considering Princess Ding's... -I told you, there's no need!

406
20:12.000 --> 20:13.550
Those officials from Tianhuang City

407
20:13.550 --> 20:14.480
won't make trouble

408
20:14.480 --> 20:15.640
for our Ji family

409
20:15.640 --> 20:17.160
over a mere gambling den.

410
20:17.160 --> 20:17.830
Brother.

411
20:18.030 --> 20:19.240
We cannot do things

412
20:19.240 --> 20:21.040
-that violate the law. -Shut up!

413
20:26.000 --> 20:26.880
Yun.

414
20:28.500 --> 20:29.160
[Old Madam Gong]

415
20:29.160 --> 20:30.070
Hao.

416
20:32.500 --> 20:33.670
Chen.

417
20:36.770 --> 20:38.430
Chen...

418
20:39.640 --> 20:40.440
Grandma.

419
20:40.790 --> 20:41.590
Grandma.

420
20:42.310 --> 20:43.780
What are you yelling for?

421
20:45.400 --> 20:46.480
Didn't you hear

422
20:46.480 --> 20:48.550
my children talking?

423
20:50.350 --> 20:51.960
They said they were tired

424
20:52.310 --> 20:53.110
and wanted to

425
20:53.110 --> 20:54.710
lie down and get a good sleep.

426
21:00.770 --> 21:01.810
Who are you?

427
21:05.730 --> 21:06.520
Grandma,

428
21:07.360 --> 21:09.360
I am your grandson,

429
21:09.510 --> 21:10.310
Gong Le.

430
21:13.510 --> 21:15.070
Why did you run out again?

431
21:20.960 --> 21:23.350
Old Madam, Old Madam.

432
21:24.160 --> 21:26.070
Didn't we agree?

433
21:26.200 --> 21:27.480
If you refuse to listen

434
21:27.480 --> 21:29.010
and continue to run around,

435
21:30.070 --> 21:31.480
then your grandson

436
21:32.040 --> 21:33.980
will have to take a beating for you.

437
21:38.960 --> 21:40.620
Old Madam, watch out.

438
21:40.720 --> 21:41.960
The whip might hit you.

439
21:41.960 --> 21:42.720
Stop hitting him.

440
21:42.720 --> 21:43.400
Stop hitting

441
21:43.400 --> 21:44.440
my grandson...

442
21:47.480 --> 21:48.480
My grandson.

443
21:48.480 --> 21:49.790
M-My grandson!

444
21:49.790 --> 21:50.920
S-Stop hitting him!

445
21:51.390 --> 21:52.390
Stop it!

446
21:52.750 --> 21:53.920
I... I was wrong.

447
21:53.920 --> 21:55.590
I was wrong. Stop hitting him.

448
21:55.610 --> 21:57.260
I'm scared.

449
21:57.290 --> 21:59.430
-Take Old Madam away -I’m scared!

450
21:59.450 --> 22:00.490
for some rest.

451
22:00.630 --> 22:01.980
Let's go, Old Madam.

452
22:02.350 --> 22:03.070
N-No.

453
22:03.070 --> 22:04.400
Don't look anymore.

454
22:04.400 --> 22:06.510
-I’m scared. -Let’s go back and rest.

455
22:07.200 --> 22:08.180
Stop hitting him.

456
22:08.180 --> 22:09.360
Stop hitting him.

457
22:17.110 --> 22:19.610
[Coroner's Office]

458
22:25.880 --> 22:26.680
Zhe Shan.

459
22:27.400 --> 22:28.200
That's right.

460
22:28.510 --> 22:29.940
He is Zhe Shan.

461
22:30.240 --> 22:31.750
Are you sure?

462
22:32.150 --> 22:34.000
I recognize his clothes.

463
22:34.000 --> 22:36.000
He also developed cauliflower ears

464
22:36.200 --> 22:37.400
from the numerous injuries

465
22:37.400 --> 22:39.330
he sustained in the fighting ring.

466
22:39.400 --> 22:40.260
No need to look.

467
22:40.830 --> 22:41.680
It's him.

468
22:42.920 --> 22:44.010
You just said

469
22:44.030 --> 22:45.660
he didn't drown.

470
22:45.790 --> 22:46.550
Then,

471
22:47.240 --> 22:49.000
how exactly did he die?

472
22:49.030 --> 22:50.490
Regarding this question,

473
22:50.510 --> 22:51.880
we also want to know.

474
22:52.570 --> 22:54.770
That's why we invited you here, Boss Ji.

475
22:59.350 --> 23:00.160
Zhe Shan

476
23:00.720 --> 23:02.830
was a first-class boxer of the Ji family.

477
23:02.830 --> 23:04.160
You must know

478
23:04.550 --> 23:05.830
something about him, right?

479
23:05.830 --> 23:06.640
Of course.

480
23:07.350 --> 23:09.240
Zhe Shan was an old member of my household.

481
23:09.240 --> 23:11.100
He had been with me for many years.

482
23:11.440 --> 23:13.550
Other than being fond of picking fights

483
23:13.550 --> 23:14.310
and bragging,

484
23:14.310 --> 23:15.960
he didn’t have any major faults.

485
23:15.960 --> 23:16.750
However,

486
23:17.110 --> 23:18.680
he was highly skilled.

487
23:18.790 --> 23:20.510
To expand the Hound Pit's business,

488
23:20.510 --> 23:22.200
I let him fight in the ring.

489
23:22.270 --> 23:23.070
Oh, right.

490
23:23.640 --> 23:25.590
He did have a habit.

491
23:26.350 --> 23:28.350
Whenever he won money from fighting,

492
23:28.350 --> 23:30.270
he'd go to Yulu Hall in town

493
23:30.440 --> 23:31.570
to drink with women,

494
23:31.960 --> 23:33.960
and wouldn't return until late at night.

495
23:33.960 --> 23:34.960
So annoying.

496
23:35.030 --> 23:36.030
Make sure you come on time.

497
23:36.030 --> 23:36.790
You must come.

498
23:36.790 --> 23:39.830
-What nonsense about being invincible? -Remember to miss us.

499
23:39.830 --> 23:43.270
I, Zhe Shan, am invincible in the world!

500
23:44.200 --> 23:46.310
-Who dares to disagree? -Normally,

501
23:46.310 --> 23:47.720
with Zhe Shan's skills,

502
23:47.720 --> 23:48.350
ordinary people

503
23:48.350 --> 23:50.080
couldn't even get close to him.

504
23:50.310 --> 23:52.400
Only when he was walking alone and drunk

505
23:52.400 --> 23:54.610
was it the best time to strike.

506
23:55.160 --> 23:56.750
To destroy the evidence,

507
23:56.790 --> 23:57.650
the killer then

508
23:57.720 --> 23:59.590
threw the body into the Yan River.

509
24:01.200 --> 24:02.110
Boss Ji.

510
24:02.920 --> 24:04.720
That's a very good deduction.

511
24:06.000 --> 24:08.000
As for who the killer is,

512
24:08.000 --> 24:09.350
it's hard to say.

513
24:09.590 --> 24:11.050
After all, over the years,

514
24:11.510 --> 24:13.720
Zhe Shan defeated

515
24:13.790 --> 24:15.030
countless people.

516
24:15.550 --> 24:17.610
Since they couldn't beat him openly,

517
24:17.640 --> 24:19.590
they could only

518
24:19.750 --> 24:21.680
resort to dirty tricks in the dark.

519
24:27.440 --> 24:28.240
Boss Ji.

520
24:29.030 --> 24:30.590
Did Zhe Shan and Gong Sihai

521
24:30.590 --> 24:31.510
have any grudges?

522
24:31.510 --> 24:32.550
Gong Sihai?

523
24:34.960 --> 24:36.000
Do you mean

524
24:36.000 --> 24:38.000
Gong Sihai killed Zhe Shan?

525
24:38.240 --> 24:39.510
This is an official questioning.

526
24:39.510 --> 24:41.070
Just answer the question.

527
24:41.440 --> 24:42.570
Stop overthinking.

528
24:44.790 --> 24:45.960
You all saw what happened

529
24:45.960 --> 24:47.090
at the dock that day.

530
24:47.750 --> 24:50.160
The Gong family has always been bullies,

531
24:50.240 --> 24:52.000
especially the subordinates.

532
24:52.200 --> 24:53.730
They always act out of line.

533
24:54.310 --> 24:55.960
Every time, Zhe Shan stepped forward

534
24:55.960 --> 24:57.200
to teach them a lesson.

535
24:57.200 --> 24:59.200
Isn't that a slap in the face to them?

536
24:59.790 --> 25:00.590
In my opinion,

537
25:00.790 --> 25:02.510
Gong Sihai must have

538
25:02.720 --> 25:03.550
felt that my men

539
25:03.550 --> 25:05.350
were more capable than his,

540
25:05.610 --> 25:06.880
so he deliberately took revenge

541
25:06.880 --> 25:08.310
and killed Zhe Shan.

542
25:08.310 --> 25:09.160
It's not

543
25:09.160 --> 25:10.510
impossible.

544
25:11.830 --> 25:14.160
Thank you for making the trip, Boss Ji.

545
25:14.720 --> 25:17.160
Go back and rest early.

546
25:20.830 --> 25:22.350
I'll take my leave.

547
25:23.160 --> 25:24.110
My Lords,

548
25:24.590 --> 25:25.640
if there is anything

549
25:25.640 --> 25:26.880
I can do for you,

550
25:27.110 --> 25:28.590
just let me know.

551
25:29.400 --> 25:31.200
Outside Mingling County,

552
25:31.200 --> 25:32.330
I can't say for sure.

553
25:35.790 --> 25:37.680
But in this territory,

554
25:38.790 --> 25:40.790
I still have the final say.

555
25:48.990 --> 25:52.510
[Coroner's Office]

556
25:52.510 --> 25:53.310
Master.

557
25:55.110 --> 25:55.650
Bah! Who do you think you are?

558
25:55.650 --> 25:57.220
[Coroner's Office]

559
25:57.590 --> 25:59.850
Our county magistrate has the final say.

560
26:07.110 --> 26:07.920
My Lord.

561
26:07.970 --> 26:09.210
You asked me to check

562
26:09.250 --> 26:10.710
the travel permit records

563
26:10.750 --> 26:12.350
for people coming from Tianhuang City to Mingling County

564
26:12.350 --> 26:13.920
in the 20th year of Hongyun.

565
26:14.790 --> 26:16.850
I looked through them several times,

566
26:16.960 --> 26:18.350
and none of the permits

567
26:18.350 --> 26:20.280
had the seal of the Ministry of War.

568
26:21.350 --> 26:22.410
No travel permits?

569
26:23.550 --> 26:25.230
Without permits, could it be

570
26:25.590 --> 26:28.050
that they went straight into the mountains?

571
26:28.350 --> 26:29.200
Well...

572
26:29.720 --> 26:31.180
Mingling County is small,

573
26:31.310 --> 26:33.640
and there are no military camps or city defenses around.

574
26:33.640 --> 26:35.160
It's reasonable for the Ministry of War officials

575
26:35.160 --> 26:36.240
from Tianhuang City

576
26:36.240 --> 26:37.570
to not visit for months.

577
26:37.680 --> 26:38.480
Also,

578
26:38.640 --> 26:41.000
there was an epidemic in the county that year.

579
26:41.000 --> 26:43.000
It was impossible for outsiders to move

580
26:43.000 --> 26:44.600
to our county at that time...

581
26:45.090 --> 26:46.550
Except for the Ji family.

582
26:47.400 --> 26:48.200
The Ji family?

583
26:52.200 --> 26:54.000
The Ji family also moved to Mingling County

584
26:54.000 --> 26:55.330
in the 20th year of Hongyun?

585
26:55.330 --> 26:56.310
Yes.

586
26:56.530 --> 26:58.390
The county annals can't be wrong.

587
26:59.110 --> 26:59.920
My Lord.

588
26:59.920 --> 27:01.230
As for the travel permit,

589
27:01.230 --> 27:03.830
I will look into the records from other months.

590
27:04.200 --> 27:05.000
No need.

591
27:09.790 --> 27:11.990
I will keep an eye on this matter myself.

592
27:13.280 --> 27:13.350
[Mingling County Government]

593
27:13.350 --> 27:14.200
Xiu Niang.

594
27:14.240 --> 27:14.350
[Mingling County Government]

595
27:14.350 --> 27:14.960
Master.

596
27:14.960 --> 27:16.720
Instead of taking care of the Second Master at home,

597
27:16.720 --> 27:18.050
what are you doing here?

598
27:18.430 --> 27:19.230
Master.

599
27:23.920 --> 27:24.720
Brother.

600
27:27.200 --> 27:28.130
Second Brother.

601
27:29.590 --> 27:30.590
Why are you here?

602
27:31.510 --> 27:32.920
I was worried about you.

603
27:33.110 --> 27:34.590
How many times have I told you

604
27:34.590 --> 27:36.520
not to meddle in external affairs?

605
27:37.000 --> 27:38.790
But today is different.

606
27:40.160 --> 27:41.800
The Divine Constable Bureau is here this time.

607
27:41.800 --> 27:42.960
[Mingling County Government]

608
27:42.960 --> 27:44.750
Why did they have to come

609
27:45.350 --> 27:47.110
at this exact moment?

610
27:54.000 --> 27:54.790
Brother.

611
27:56.400 --> 27:57.200
Do you think

612
27:57.590 --> 27:59.640
something happened to His Highness Prince Ding

613
27:59.640 --> 28:01.750
and Her Highness—

614
28:01.750 --> 28:02.400
Insolent!

615
28:03.590 --> 28:04.350
Ji Lao'er.

616
28:05.200 --> 28:06.800
You are cursing our Ji family

617
28:06.920 --> 28:08.200
and me!

618
28:09.400 --> 28:10.200
Go back in!

619
28:12.310 --> 28:13.640
What are you looking at?

620
28:13.960 --> 28:15.090
Back to the mansion!

621
28:16.060 --> 28:18.360
[Mingling County Government]

622
28:28.590 --> 28:29.750
Are you aware of

623
28:30.160 --> 28:31.350
the Ji family's Hound Pit?

624
28:31.350 --> 28:32.920
As the local magistrate,

625
28:33.200 --> 28:34.590
how could I be unaware?

626
28:34.920 --> 28:36.520
I've tried shutting it down.

627
28:37.560 --> 28:38.920
But every time the case was reported to

628
28:38.920 --> 28:40.200
the Prefect,

629
28:40.400 --> 28:41.750
it got silenced.

630
28:45.640 --> 28:46.440
About

631
28:48.240 --> 28:49.840
Ji Ada's deduction just now,

632
28:50.310 --> 28:52.170
what do you think of it, Lord Situ?

633
28:53.160 --> 28:55.200
I think what he said makes sense.

634
28:55.440 --> 28:56.500
There are 2 points.

635
28:56.790 --> 28:57.960
First, the time

636
28:57.960 --> 28:59.290
and place of the murder.

637
28:59.400 --> 29:02.260
Second, the killer dumped the body in the Yan River.

638
29:06.590 --> 29:07.590
What do you think?

639
29:08.030 --> 29:09.790
There are 2 suspicious points in Ji Ada's words.

640
29:09.790 --> 29:10.590
First,

641
29:11.000 --> 29:13.240
Zhe Shan died from a beast tearing his throat,

642
29:13.240 --> 29:14.680
not from a sharp weapon.

643
29:14.790 --> 29:15.550
Therefore,

644
29:15.550 --> 29:18.150
someone must have set the dog on him that night.

645
29:19.510 --> 29:21.550
The killer indeed dumped the body in the Yan River.

646
29:21.550 --> 29:22.400
But,

647
29:24.160 --> 29:26.200
from the alley behind Yulu Hall

648
29:26.200 --> 29:28.000
to the Yan River in Mount Fuyao,

649
29:28.000 --> 29:29.920
it's nearly a 10 km walk.

650
29:30.310 --> 29:32.240
Even if the killer had great stamina

651
29:32.240 --> 29:34.000
and could carry the body,

652
29:34.030 --> 29:34.830
how

653
29:35.000 --> 29:37.270
could he ensure that

654
29:37.640 --> 29:39.200
no one saw him along the way?

655
29:40.160 --> 29:41.310
Look at this build.

656
29:41.510 --> 29:42.550
Even if it were me,

657
29:42.960 --> 29:44.750
I'd not be able to carry this body

658
29:44.750 --> 29:46.200
over the mountains for 10 km

659
29:46.200 --> 29:47.350
in a single sitting,

660
29:47.350 --> 29:49.810
let alone have the strength to dispose of it.

661
29:51.720 --> 29:52.790
Did the killer

662
29:54.440 --> 29:55.550
use a carriage?

663
29:58.000 --> 29:58.960
Lord Situ.

664
30:00.510 --> 30:02.370
Who in the county owns a carriage?

665
30:03.310 --> 30:06.000
Those who can afford a carriage in the county

666
30:06.200 --> 30:07.660
are all wealthy families.

667
30:08.310 --> 30:09.260
Great.

668
30:09.550 --> 30:11.000
After investigating around,

669
30:11.000 --> 30:13.460
it seems we have to go back to the Gong family.

670
30:14.510 --> 30:15.400
But I think

671
30:15.400 --> 30:18.200
the Ji family's Hound Pit is also a bit suspicious.

672
30:20.310 --> 30:21.350
Why don't we

673
30:21.510 --> 30:23.160
split up tonight

674
30:23.240 --> 30:25.570
and investigate the Gong and Ji families?

675
30:25.790 --> 30:26.590
How about it?

676
30:27.070 --> 30:27.590
Okay.

677
30:29.460 --> 30:31.230
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

678
30:37.960 --> 30:39.200
Where did the dog go?

679
30:42.400 --> 30:43.160
I was going to start

680
30:43.160 --> 30:44.760
with the Black Silk Leopard.

681
30:45.350 --> 30:46.550
Why is it gone?

682
30:46.550 --> 30:47.400
