834
40:32.510 --> 40:33.190
Stop!

835
40:33.190 --> 40:34.000
Stop!

836
40:34.800 --> 40:35.550
Stop!

837
40:37.110 --> 40:37.800
Stop!

838
40:37.800 --> 40:39.150
